<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>FoxIA - Crie Foto e Vídeo com IA</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
body{margin:0;background:#0f0f0f;color:white;text-align:center;padding:0 14px 40px}
header{padding:28px 10px 10px}
.logo{font-size:64px}
h1{font-size:32px;margin:5px 0;color:#ff7a00}
h1 span{color:white}
p.sub{color:#bbb;margin:0 0 18px}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:10px;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto 18px}
.tab{flex:1;padding:13px;border-radius:14px;background:#1e1e1e;border:2px solid #333;cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold;color:#aaa}
.tab.active{background:#ff7a00;color:white;border-color:#ff7a00}
.card{background:#1a1a1a;border:1px solid #2a2a2a;border-radius:20px;padding:18px;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto;text-align:left}
label{font-size:13px;color:#ccc;font-weight:bold}
textarea,input,select{width:100%;padding:13px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #333;background:#222;color:white;margin:7px 0 12px;font-size:15px;outline:none}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.chip{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:20px;background:#262626;border:1px solid #333;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}
.chip.active{background:#ff7a00;border-color:#ff7a00}
button{width:100%;padding:15px;border:none;border-radius:14px;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}
.btn-main{background:#ff7a00;color:white}
.btn-ghost{background:#262626;color:white;margin-top:10px}
.btn-green{background:#25D366;color:white;margin-top:10px}
#result{margin-top:16px;display:none}
#result img{width:100%;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #333}
.badge{display:inline-block;background:#ff7a00;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:10px}
.videoBox{background:#222;border-radius:14px;padding:14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:left}
.small{font-size:12px;color:#999;margin-top:10px;line-height:1.5}
.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:18px;max-width:500px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.gallery img{width:100%;border-radius:14px;cursor:pointer;border:2px solid #222}
footer{margin-top:22px;color:#777;font-size:12px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">🦊</div>
<h1>Fox<span>IA</span> PRO</h1>
<p class="sub">A raposa que cria foto e vídeo pra você em segundos</p>
<div style="background:#ff7a00;color:white;display:inline-block;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px">✨ + 2.300 criações hoje</div>
</header>

<div class="tabs">
<div class="tab active" id="tabFoto" onclick="showTab('foto')">📸 FOTO</div>
<div class="tab" id="tabVideo" onclick="showTab('video')">🎬 VÍDEO</div>
</div>

<!-- FOTO -->
<div class="card" id="cardFoto">
<label>🎲 O que você quer criar?</label>
<textarea id="prompt" rows="3" placeholder="Ex: raposa laranja no espaço...">Raposa laranja fofa na floresta mágica</textarea>
<label>🎨 Escolha o estilo</label>
<div class="chips" id="styles">
<div class="chip active" data-v="3D Pixar style, cute, ultra detailed, vibrant colors, cinematic lighting">🧸 Pixar 3D</div>
<div class="chip" data-v="anime style, beautiful, colorful, highly detailed">🌸 Anime</div>
<div class="chip" data-v="realistic photo, professional photography, 8k, sharp">📷 Realista</div>
<div class="chip" data-v="Disney style, magical, colorful">🏰 Disney</div>
<div class="chip" data-v="lego style, toy, colorful">🧱 Lego</div>
<div class="chip" data-v="cyberpunk, neon lights, futuristic">🌃 Cyberpunk</div>
<div class="chip" data-v="watercolor painting, artistic">🎨 Aquarela</div>
<div class="chip" data-v="hyper realistic, professional, studio light">✨ Profissional</div>
</div>
<button class="btn-main" onclick="gerarFoto()">✨ GERAR IMAGEM MÁGICA</button>
<button class="btn-ghost" onclick="surpreender()">🎲 SURPREENDA-ME</button>
<div id="result">
<span class="badge">🔥 SUA CRIAÇÃO PRONTA</span>
<img id="imgOut" src="">
<button class="btn-main" style="margin-top:10px" onclick="baixar()">⬇️ BAIXAR EM HD</button>
<button class="btn-green" onclick="compartilhar()">💚 COMPARTILHAR NO WHATSAPP</button>
</div>
</div>

<!-- VIDEO -->
<div class="card" id="cardVideo" style="display:none">
<label>🎬 Qual vídeo você quer?</label>
<textarea id="promptVideo"